      "text" : "Welcome"
    },
    {
      "id" : "p2",
      "text" : "This folder is a small community of Origami Documents. Every document is a single, human-readable JSON file that carries its own metadata — nothing essential lives anywhere else."
    },
    {
      "id" : "p3",
      "text" : "Click any citation to follow it; documents that cite each other appear in the Connections view. New versions never overwrite old ones: history only grows."
    }
  ],
